OL,3,GNEWSACouncils warned of risks of high
OL,4,Astreet pedestrianisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has warned councils
OL,7,Fagainst ill-considered plans to
OL,8,Fpedestrianise high streets in England.
OL,10,FIn evidence submitted to an inquiry by
OL,11,FMPs, the Ministry of Housing,
OL,12,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,13,F(MHCLG) said pedestrianisation can make
OL,14,Fhigh streets "more attractive, safe and
OL,15,Fwelcoming".
OL,17,FBut the department added that "the
OL,18,Fprocess needs to be well considered",
OL,19,Fwarning that removing traffic could
OL,20,Fmake high streets less accessible and
OL,21,Fdamage local economies.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
