OL,3,GNEWSACouncils warned of risks of high
OL,4,Astreet pedestrianisation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Local leaders pursuing
OL,7,Fpedestrianisation must be aware of the
OL,8,Frisks and work to mitigate them, within
OL,9,Fa broader spatial strategy," the
OL,10,Fevidence says.
